+### Dependencies
+
+- **webbluetooth** → 0.0.5, together with every BLE device crate on it: awear 0.3.1, emotibit 0.1.1, idun 0.0.5, mendi 0.0.4, muse-rs 0.2.4, mw75 0.0.9, poop 0.0.3, vital 0.0.3, and the vendored openbci. All of them still share one `Bluetooth::shared()` session. Five of the device crates also asked for `webbluetooth-wasm` 0.0.4 directly in their browser builds, which `cargo tree` on a desktop does not show; they are on 0.0.5 too.
+
+### Build
+
